 "_doc": "Chibi sprites. File = sprites/<id>.webp (idle) and <id>_attack/_hurt/_down.webp when poses has them. id = the game's art id when one exists (por_*, hero_*, mon_*, boss_*), otherwise the content id (npc/monster id); _aliases maps content ids to sprite ids. All poses of one id share one canvas (w x h); draw the canvas suggestedHeightTiles tall with its bottom-centre on the tile's bottom-centre; sprites face left, flip for the party. Battle objects with states (stateGroup) share one canvas and one suggestedHeightTiles: swap the file, keep the box; bodyHeightTiles is the height of the object itself without steam / sound arcs. kind 'decal' = ground decal seen from above: stretch it over the wTiles x hTiles cell rectangle whose top-left cell is the placement cell, and draw it under the units.",
